et lost and sometimes stubborn as they learn how to walk.\nBut you'll be able to save all the slippers.\n\nA new concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\uba54\uc778(2)1440_1440(211029) \ud55c\uae00.png", "id": "843670026323221", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974680_843670029656554_4170918606599011011_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UgrOEFM27CoQ7kNvwHCS29O&_nc_oc=Adm39kMQB_9B6iluxA1vsVjscx4njVIDX-wCfifmi5QFGhN6vqF5wLnAhxmZLhbfDnQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsqsRgxFo423JMs-UemzNvM_byN2LUGhnC6iCC_WJA0ag&oe=699B071F"}, {"file_name": "\uba54\uc778(\uc2dc\uc5482)2560_1440(211029) \ud55c\uae00.png", "id": "627571058261409", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036641_627571061594742_7128199620299863828_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l5Oa0FGSmeUQ7kNvwHGCJFs&_nc_oc=AdmqOIn9bD9e5Z00sRQxX99BTxsGLxwXO5e08OvjcgWQ1kgEQCczNefLj5-K7CzWI78&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftAL9mO7Gtoy7P-1NVtMyUl14hpT4JRgz2-3KTHe9Ry1A&oe=699B0307"}, {"file_name": "app_logo.png", "id": "583935226146634", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223477_583935232813300_935540870816570877_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FR5BcjD6QsYQ7kNvwG3RsVO&_nc_oc=AdnMP3IapXs-8et4JQf43s1hQk10tF1FbPrWSRdgXdyHoybKHf74l1MdwmXdT_vRkk4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuB3kNYCiQs3ZKsqypq9NgIswaVUpIKfnmqVr9pMlwWMQ&oe=699B0757"}, {"file_name": "